response:
An investigation conducted by CERT-UA and the Cyber Security Center of Military Unit A0334 revealed targeted cyberattacks by threat actor UAC-0149 against the Defense Forces of Ukraine. The threat actor distributed a malicious Excel macro file via the Signal messaging app, which retrieved a secondary PowerShell script (mob2002.data) from GitHub. This script established persistence via the Windows Registry and deployed the PowerShell backdoor COOKBOX, which used dynamic DNS domains and Cloudflare Workers for command-and-control communications.

